  <h1 class="lead-head">Russia Legalizes Bitcoin Trading, Caps Retail Buyers at $3,700 a Year</h1>
  <p class="deck">Putin signed the law this month and the central bank has cleared bitcoin for licensed exchanges &mdash; but ordinary Russians can buy only about $3,700 of it a year.</p>
  <div class="byline">The Bitcoin Beacon Newsroom &bull; Policy &amp; Nation-States Desk</div>

  <!-- HERO: the SAME house-style illustration used on the website article for the lead story. -->
